                                "sense_id": "f677b814-455c-3a17-9d85-f7edcdeae647",
                                "text": "We went through that stage in Apple where we went out and we thought we're going to be a big company, let's hire professional management. We went out and hired a bunch of professional management. It didn't work at all. Most of them were bozos. They knew how to manage but they did not know how to do anything."
